# WordPress PHP Conventions

See `checklistdek-compliance.mdc` for the security gate.

## File Header

Every PHP file must start with:

```php
<?php
/**
 * Brief description.
 *
 * @package ChecklistDek
 */

if ( ! defined( 'ABSPATH' ) ) {
	exit;
}
```

## Security

- Admin pages: `CHECKLISTDEK_Capabilities::current_user_can( $cap )` — not raw `manage_options` except in capability class itself.
- REST routes: `permission_callback` on every route; delegate to `CHECKLISTDEK_REST_API::can_*()` methods.
- Escape output: `esc_html()`, `esc_attr()`, `esc_url()`, `esc_html__()`, `esc_html_e()`.
- Sanitize settings via `CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::sanitize()` as `sanitize_callback`.
- Settings API: `show_in_rest => false`.
- Never return decrypted app passwords in REST responses; mask or omit `app_password_enc`.
- SQL: `$wpdb->prepare()` only; all queries in `*_Repository` classes (and `CHECKLISTDEK_Audit_Log`). Plugin table names via `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository::table()` / `::tags_table()`, `CHECKLISTDEK_Checklist_Repository::table()`, `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::table()` / `::steps_table()`, `CHECKLISTDEK_Audit_Log::table_name()` — use `%i` in prepare where supported; site-scoped audit filters may use `EXISTS` subqueries on trusted `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::table()` when `%i` cannot cover the full statement.

## WordPress APIs

- Register hooks in `CHECKLISTDEK_Plugin::run()` or static `::register()` on service classes — not in bootstrap.
- REST namespace: `CHECKLISTDEK_REST_NAMESPACE` (`checklistdek/v1`).
- Enqueue assets with `filemtime()` fallback to `CHECKLISTDEK_VERSION`. Plugin screens enqueue `wp-components` (style + script) and `heartbeat` (script) for admin JS — powers `openConfirmModal()` via `wp.components.__experimentalConfirmDialog` and `initRestNonceRefresh()`. Client panel script also lists `heartbeat` as a dependency.
- Localize `checklistdekAdmin` with `rest_url()`, `admin_url( 'admin-ajax.php' )` as `ajaxUrl`, `wp_create_nonce( 'wp_rest' )`, and translatable strings (including `strings.sessionExpired` for admin-ajax stale nonce handling). `billing` (`CHECKLISTDEK_Licensing::get_summary()`), billing gate strings, and `billingUrl` only when `checklistdek_includes_pro_package()`; omit capture/vault string keys on Community when plan lacks those features. On dashboard, Checklists, and Settings, localize `templates` (`preloaded`, filtered `builtin` catalog, plan-scoped `categories` from `get_template_categories_for_plan()`) so template picker and built-in grid avoid an initial `GET /templates`. On the Checklists screen, also localize `customChecklists` (`preloaded` + `summary_list` items for non-template checklists) and `clientPreview` (`panelTitle`, `defaultPanelTitle`, `brandName`, preview UI strings). On the Sites screen, localize `sites` (`preloaded`, `list`, `groups` from `get_site_group_catalog()`). On the Activity Logs screen, localize `activityLogs` (`preloaded`, `sites` from `picker_list()`, `initialSiteId`, `initialFeedPreload`, `initialFeed` from first-page `CHECKLISTDEK_Audit_Log::query()`). On the Integrations screen, localize `integrations` (`preloaded` + `CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations::get_page_bootstrap()` — `connectors`, `telemetry.rules`, `telemetry.fields`).
- Page slugs: use `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin::PAGE_SLUG` + suffixes.

## Class Wiring

- Bootstrap requires `includes/checklistdek-build.php` first (`CHECKLISTDEK_BUILD` default `full`), then `includes/checklistdek-freemius.php` when `!checklistdek_is_community_build()` (Freemius SDK from `vendor/freemius/` — omitted from Community zip), then core classes; site/checklist/run repositories load before `class-checklistdek-installer.php` (installer migrations call repository `::table()` helpers). `checklistdek_require_pro_modules()` loads auto-capture + email notifier only in full builds; webhook dispatcher and drift cron paths come from `checklistdek_get_*_file()` (Community uses `includes/community/` stubs). Instantiate only via `checklistdek_run_plugin()`. `class-checklistdek-licensing.php` loads with core includes (plan gates, `checklistdek_billing` option; Community build forces Community plan). `class-checklistdek-admin-deep-links.php` loads before checklist/run repositories (used during step normalization). `class-checklistdek-admin-ajax.php` loads with admin classes. Hook Freemius-driven plan changes via `cld_fs_loaded` / licensing integration — keep feature gates in `CHECKLISTDEK_Licensing`.
- `CHECKLISTDEK_Plugin` constructor: `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin` only. `CHECKLISTDEK_Plugin::run()` also calls `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Ajax::register()`. `CHECKLISTDEK_Plugin::init()` calls `CHECKLISTDEK_Templates::bootstrap_builtin_templates()` and `CHECKLISTDEK_Plugin::should_sync_builtin_templates()` (admin, REST, cron, ajax — skips public front-end after seed).
- Data layer: `CHECKLISTDEK_{Site,Checklist,Run}_Repository` — no direct `$wpdb` in REST handlers or admin.
- Remote: `CHECKLISTDEK_Remote_Client::from_site( $id )` for authenticated requests (returns `null` if credentials missing). Constructor normalizes site URL via `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository::normalize_url()`, sanitizes username with `sanitize_user()`, and requires string app password. REST site create / `test_raw_connection` validate and normalize the same fields before `Connection_Tester` / repository insert. `request()` tries `/wp-json{route}` then `?rest_route=` when `is_rest_no_route_response()` (404 + `rest_no_route` code). Error messages for storage/display use protected `sanitize_remote_message()` (`wp_strip_all_tags` + `sanitize_textarea_field`) in `request()`, connection tests, and `log_connection()` (also applied before `last_error` updates).
- Connection tests: `CHECKLISTDEK_Connection_Tester::test_site()` / `::test_raw()` attach `client_panel` (and `client_agent` when installed) on successful ping — raw test uses `panel_available()` probe only (no deploy until site save).
- Client panel: `CHECKLISTDEK_Mu_Plugin_Installer::ensure_installed( $site_id )` on site create/update/test and when `push_run( $id, $prepare, $sync_bundle )` is called with `$sync_bundle = true` (defaults to `$prepare`; manual refresh uses `push_run( $id, false, true )`); `::sync_run()` → `push_run( $id, false, false )` (snapshot only, no bundle reinstall); token callbacks pass `$skip_client_sync = true` on `complete_client_step()` / `uncomplete_client_step()` / `add_client_step_note()` and return `snapshot` for client local apply; `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::ensure_client_token()` backfills legacy runs; `::filter_step_notes()` / `::step_notes_match()` dedupe hub notes; `::archive()` / `::delete()` for run history (`is_archived` soft-hide); `::list_for_site_history()` for paginated lean site history with batched step progress; `CHECKLISTDEK_Step_Executor::mark_manual_incomplete()` for hub-side manual uncomplete; `CHECKLISTDEK_Auto_Capture::{get_status,start,stop,clear}()` proxies capture sessions to remote panel; `CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::get_client_panel_layout()` / `::get_client_panel_layouts()` configure snapshot `panel_layout` (legacy `left_sidebar` / `split_panel` sanitize to `sidebar`); `::get_client_panel_title()` / `::sanitize_client_panel_title()` / `::save_client_panel_title()` configure snapshot `panel_title` (Settings form + builder `#checklistdek-cl-panel-title` via `POST /settings/client-panel-title`); `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Deep_Links::{resolve_path,normalize_stored_path,infer_path_from_text,path_from_api_step}()` resolve wp-admin paths for step deep links; snapshots include both `deep_link` (remote full URL) and `admin_path` (path only for client `admin_url()` rebuild). Client `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Run_Store::{get_panel_title,user_can_view_panel}()` — panel UI/REST/assets gated on read cap + step role alignment (`manage_options` always). Checklists screen enqueues `mu-plugin/checklistdek-client/css/checklistdek-client-admin.css` as `checklistdek-client-admin-preview` for builder live preview only.
- Credentials: `CHECKLISTDEK_Credential_Vault::encrypt()` / `::decrypt()` on save/read.
- Audit: `CHECKLISTDEK_Audit_Log::log()` for privileged actions; detail value formatting strips tags via `wp_strip_all_tags` + `sanitize_textarea_field` on string values; `::list_query_args_from_input()` shared sanitizer for REST feed + admin-ajax activity logs; `::query()` with optional `paginate`, `include_details` (lean list omits heavy `detail_fields` / decoded details; dashboard `get_feed()` passes `include_details => false`); site filter matches direct `site_id` or run-linked rows via `EXISTS` on `checklistdek_runs`; `::get_decoded_details( $id )` for lean raw JSON fetch; `::find( $id )` for single entry; `LIST_DEFAULT_LIMIT` (50) / `LIST_MAX_LIMIT` (100); batch context maps in `build_query_context()` (users, sites, runs, step titles); `::format_row()` returns human-readable `message`, `action_label`, `details_summary`, `detail_fields` (`format_activity_detail_fields()`), legacy `detail_lines`, `show_run_timeline`, `outcome_class`, `has_details`; `::format_details_summary()` / `::format_activity_detail_lines()` / `::get_run_steps_timeline()` / `::log_supports_run_timeline()` power Activity Logs copy; `::feed_entry_show_site_label()` / `::format_feed_message( $entry, $embed_site )` shape dashboard feed copy; `::log()` invalidates `CHECKLISTDEK_Dashboard_Cache::invalidate_feed()`.
- Dashboard cache: `CHECKLISTDEK_Dashboard_Cache::{get_stats,get_connection_counts,get_feed,get_sites_list,get_quick_launch_picker}()` read from `checklistdek_dashboard_cache`; `::refresh_sites_list()` delegates to `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository::all()`; `::refresh_quick_launch_picker()` delegates to `picker_list()` (cap 500 each); repositories call `invalidate_stats()` / `invalidate_connections()` / `invalidate_sites_list()` / `invalidate_quick_launch_picker()` on mutations. `::clear()` on uninstall.
- Sites list: `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository::{all,format_list,get_tags_map,row_has_stored_credentials,list_select_columns}()` — list queries omit decrypting `app_password_enc` (SQL `has_credentials_flag`); `format( $row, $context )` accepts preloaded tags and `list_credentials` for batched output. List limits: `LIST_DEFAULT_LIMIT` 500, `LIST_MAX_LIMIT` 1000, `PICKER_LIMIT` 500.
- Integration sync: `CHECKLISTDEK_Integration_Sync::{preview,sync}()` orchestrate connector site inventory import; when `summary.total === 0` and adapter implements `get_sync_diagnostics()` (MainWP, WP Umbrella), response includes `diagnostics.hint`; `CHECKLISTDEK_Telemetry_Mapper::map( $integration_slug, $platform_row )` applies enabled telemetry rules; `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository::{find_by_external,upsert_from_integration,list_by_integration,count_by_integration_sources,ensure_integration_tag,normalize_url,has_credentials,get_distinct_group_types}()` persist synced sites and group catalogs; `CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations::get_page_bootstrap()` preloads connector statuses + telemetry rules for Integrations screen; MainWP panel deploy without hub credentials uses `CHECKLISTDEK_MainWP_Agent::install_panel( $mainwp_site_id )`. WP Umbrella: `CHECKLISTDEK_Integration_WP_Umbrella` — `supports_site_sync()`, `fetch_platform_sites()` via Public API `/projects`, `verify_api_token()` (lightweight projects probe), `get_sync_diagnostics()`, `push_agent()` for synced sites with hub Application Passwords; `CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::{normalize_wp_umbrella_api_token,has_wp_umbrella_api_token,get_wp_umbrella_api_token,save_wp_umbrella_api_token}()` — token encrypted in `wp_umbrella_api_token_enc` via credential vault (normalize strips accidental `Bearer ` prefix and control chars; do not `sanitize_text_field` the encrypted blob in `sanitize()`); Integrations modal saves/clears via admin-ajax `checklistdek_save_wp_umbrella_token` with pre-save verify (not Settings form). Site tag groups: `CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::{get_builtin_site_groups,get_custom_site_groups,get_site_group_catalog,add_custom_site_group,get_site_group_label}()`; custom groups persist in `custom_site_groups` (`POST /sites/groups` / `add_custom_site_group()`; sanitizer preserves array when present in `$input`).
- Licensing: `CHECKLISTDEK_Licensing` — `get_billing()` / `get_plan()` / `set_plan()` (`checklistdek_billing`, non-autoload); feature gates (`can_use_auto_capture()`, `can_use_agency_vault()`, `can_use_notifications()`, `can_use_scheduled_drift()`, `can_add_site()`); `sanitize_panel_layout()` / `get_effective_panel_layout()` / `get_panel_layouts_for_plan()`; template filtering (`filter_builtin_templates()`, `get_template_categories_for_plan()`, `is_template_category_allowed()`); `pro_required_error()` / `site_limit_error()` for REST; `sync_drift_cron()` on activation, `init`, and after plan change. Site insert enforces caps in `CHECKLISTDEK_Site_Repository` and REST site create.
- Notifications: `CHECKLISTDEK_Webhook_Dispatcher::dispatch( $event, $data )` no-ops when `!CHECKLISTDEK_Licensing::can_use_notifications()`; otherwise calls `CHECKLISTDEK_Email_Notifier::dispatch()` first (wp_mail when event is in `email_notification_events`; recipients via `get_email_notification_addresses()`; includes `drift_summary` line for `drift_detected`), then Slack/Discord/Teams webhooks only when the event is in `notification_events` and a channel URL is set (`empty( $enabled )` skips all webhook POSTs). Settings save skips persisting webhook/email notification fields when plan lacks notifications. Email body enriches run context from `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::find()` when `run_id` is present. `CHECKLISTDEK_Drift_Verifier::maybe_dispatch_drift_notification()` calls `dispatch( 'drift_detected', … )` only for checks newly in drift vs prior stored status.
- Checklist summaries: `CHECKLISTDEK_Checklist_Repository::summary_list( $args )` / `::format_summary()` return lightweight rows (`id`, `title`, `description`, `steps_count`, step id/title preview) for list/grid UIs; `GET /checklists?summary=1` (optional `is_template`, `is_vault`); `GET /templates/vault` uses `summary_list( [ 'is_vault' => true ] )`. Full list limits: `LIST_DEFAULT_LIMIT` 500, `LIST_MAX_LIMIT` 1000, `PICKER_LIMIT` 500.
- Templates: `CHECKLISTDEK_Templates::bootstrap_builtin_templates()` seeds once then syncs via `CHECKLISTDEK_Plugin::should_sync_builtin_templates()` (not on public front-end after seed).
- Activation: `CHECKLISTDEK_Activator` loads drift cron via `checklistdek_get_drift_cron_file()` (Community stub path) before `CHECKLISTDEK_Licensing::sync_drift_cron()`; sets `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin::ACTIVATION_REDIRECT_OPTION` to activating user ID (or `1`). `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin::maybe_activation_redirect()` on `admin_init` redirects eligible dashboard users once to `?onboarding=1` (capability, user match, clears flag only after checks pass, legacy transient fallback, skip when already on dashboard). `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin::{get_admin_query_page,get_admin_query_absint,has_admin_query_flag}()` sanitize read-only `$_GET` for redirects and localize. Deactivation: `CHECKLISTDEK_Deactivator` clears activation redirect option/transient and drift cron. Uninstall: `CHECKLISTDEK_Uninstaller::run()` in bootstrap — `register_uninstall_hook` when `checklistdek_is_community_build()`, else `cld_fs()->add_action( 'after_uninstall', … )` when Freemius is loaded.
- Legacy redirects (`CHECKLISTDEK_Admin::maybe_redirect_legacy_templates_page()` on `admin_init`): `?page={slug}-templates` → Checklists (Templates default tab); `?page={slug}-sites&activity_logs` → Activity Logs page.

## Settings Option Shape

```php
array(
	'enabled'                    => true,
	'encrypt_credentials'        => true,
	'drift_verification_enabled'  => true,
	'onboarding_dismissed'       => false, // set via POST /onboarding/dismiss; cleared via POST /onboarding/reset
	'slack_webhook'              => '',
	'discord_webhook'            => '',
	'teams_webhook'              => '',
	'notification_events'          => array( 'run_started', 'run_completed', 'run_failed', 'step_failed' ), // full keys incl. run_cancelled, drift_detected, client_* — see CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::get_notification_events(); Settings form save with no boxes checked stores []
	'email_notification_events'    => array( 'run_completed' ), // independent toggle set — see CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::get_email_notification_events()
	'email_notification_address'   => '', // comma-separated; empty falls back to site admin email via get_email_notification_addresses()
	'role_permissions'           => array(), // cap => array of role slugs
	'telemetry_sync_rules'       => array(), // array of { id, enabled } — see CHECKLISTDEK_Integrations::get_default_telemetry_rules()
	'exclude_options'            => array( 'url', 'email', 'wp_environment_type' ), // REST field names; legacy option names normalized on save — see CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::get_exclude_options()
	'client_panel_layout'        => 'live_topbar', // panel display mode on remote wp-admin — see CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::get_client_panel_layouts()
	'client_panel_title'         => 'Agency Checklist', // panel heading on remote wp-admin — see CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::get_client_panel_title()
	'custom_site_groups'         => array(), // { slug, label }[] — Sites UI + GET|POST /sites/groups; built-in groups are code-defined
	'wp_umbrella_api_token_enc'  => '', // encrypted Public API token — Integrations modal only (admin-ajax); never in Settings form or REST
)
```

**Settings sanitizer (`CHECKLISTDEK_Settings::sanitize`)** merges from `self::get()` then applies form fields. `notification_events` and `email_notification_events` update only when `is_settings_form_submission()` is true (Settings group `option_page`; unchecked checkboxes → empty array). Keys updated outside the Settings form must be explicitly handled when present in `$input` so a later **Save Changes** does not drop them: `onboarding_dismissed` (REST dismiss/reset uses `update_option` directly), `wp_umbrella_api_token_enc` (admin-ajax token save — preserve ciphertext as string with null-byte strip only; never `sanitize_text_field`), `custom_site_groups` (REST `add_custom_site_group()` — sanitize slug/label per entry). Do not add Settings form fields for encrypted tokens; expose only `api_token_configured` booleans in integration status payloads.

## Checklist Step Types

Steps live in `checklist.steps[]` (JSON in DB or template files).

**`manual`** — fields: `id`, `title`, `instructions`, `target_roles` (optional array of WP role slugs — UI metadata for agency assignment), `deep_link` (optional admin path — stored via `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Deep_Links::normalize_stored_path()`; backfilled via `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Deep_Links::resolve_path()` on save when empty), `show_note_field` (optional bool, default `true` — when `false`, client panel hides the per-step note textarea), `show_screenshot_field` (optional bool, default `true` when notes enabled — when `false`, client panel hides the screenshot attach button), `type: manual`. Executor sets status `awaiting_manual` and resolves admin path via `CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Deep_Links::resolve_path()` then `CHECKLISTDEK_Remote_Client::admin_link()`. User completes via `/runs/{id}/steps/{step}/complete`; revert via `/runs/{id}/steps/{step}/uncomplete`.

**Step notes** (stored on run steps in hub `checklistdek_run_steps.notes_json` + client snapshots) — array of `{ user, text, created_at, attachment_id?, attachment_url? }`. Notes require non-empty `text`. Hub persistence via `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::add_step_note()` / `sanitize_step_note()`. Optional attachments reference existing remote media library IDs; hub stores sanitized `attachment_url` for display in Automation run tracker.

**`api`** — executed by `CHECKLISTDEK_Payload_Mapper::execute()` using nested `api` object:

```php
array(
	'type'  => 'api',
	'title' => 'Step title',
	'api'   => array(
		'route'   => '/wp/v2/settings', // must start with /
		'method'  => 'GET',             // GET|POST|PUT|PATCH|DELETE
		'payload' => array(),           // request body for mutating methods
	),
)
```

Validate dry-runs with `CHECKLISTDEK_Payload_Mapper::validate()` (used by `/checklists/{id}/validate-step`) — returns `{ valid, errors, warnings }`. `execute()` and `validate()` call `filter_excluded_payload()` for mutating `/wp/v2/settings` steps; stripped keys are omitted from the remote payload and surfaced as warnings (or `WP_Error` when all fields are excluded).

## Admin Deep Links (`CHECKLISTDEK_Admin_Deep_Links`)

Resolves wp-admin paths for checklist step settings shortcuts (hub run tracker + client panel `.checklistdek-client-step-settings-link`).

| Method | Role |
|--------|------|
| `resolve_path( $step )` | Full resolution: explicit `deep_link` → API inference → `infer_path_from_text()` |
| `normalize_stored_path( $path )` | Sanitize stored admin paths (not `esc_url_raw()` — preserves `options-general.php` style paths) |
| `infer_path_from_text( $title, $instructions )` | Keyword/regex rules for common screens (Permalinks, Plugins, Users, etc.) |
| `path_from_api_step( $api )` | Map `/wp/v2/settings` and other core REST routes to admin screens |

On checklist save, `CHECKLISTDEK_Checklist_Repository` normalizes `deep_link` and backfills via `resolve_path()` when empty. Builder live inference uses `POST /checklists/infer-deep-link` (`CHECKLISTDEK_REST_API::infer_deep_link()` → `resolve_path()`). `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Push::build_snapshot()` sets `deep_link` (remote full URL) and `admin_path` (path only). Client `CHECKLISTDEK_Client_Run_Store::resolve_step_deep_link()` prefers the snapshot URL, then rebuilds from `admin_path`. `CHECKLISTDEK_Templates::repair_builtin_deep_links()` runs once (`checklistdek_deep_links_repaired`) to restore built-in template paths stripped by legacy sanitization.

## Built-in Template JSON

Files in `templates/{slug}.json`. Required fields:

```php
array(
	'title'       => 'Template title',
	'description' => 'Short summary',
	'category'    => 'security', // slug from CHECKLISTDEK_Templates::get_categories()
	'version'     => '1.0.0',
	'is_template' => true,
	'steps'       => array( /* manual|api step objects */ ),
)
```

Unknown categories fall back to `maintenance`. New JSON files are picked up by `sync_builtin()` when `bootstrap_builtin_templates()` runs (admin, REST, cron, ajax) without re-seeding.

## DB Upgrades

`CHECKLISTDEK_Installer::DB_VERSION` is `1.7.0`. `maybe_install()` always runs `migrate_launchdek_branding()` first (idempotent LaunchDek → ChecklistDek table/option/cap rename; legacy `launchdek_db_version` copied to `checklistdek_db_version`), then `migrate_from_previous()` before `install()` when the stored version is below `DB_VERSION`. Do not reference `checklistdek_workflows`, `workflow_id`, or `launchdek_*` identifiers in new code — use `checklistdek_checklists` and `checklist_id` (LaunchDek names exist only in migration helpers). Migration to 1.2.0 adds `checklistdek_sites.client_agent` and `checklistdek_runs.client_run_token`. Migration to 1.3.0 adds `checklistdek_run_steps.notes_json` (JSON array of step notes). Migration to 1.4.0 adds `checklistdek_runs.is_archived` (indexed tinyint; archive hides from default history). Migration to 1.5.0 adds `checklistdek_sites.integration_source` and `checklistdek_sites.external_id` (composite index `integration_source_external`). Migration to 1.6.0 adds performance indexes on runs (site history, status+archived), run steps (run_id+step_index), audit log (site_id+created_at), and site tags (group_type+tag+site_id) via `migrate_performance_indexes()` / `add_index_if_missing()`. Version `1.7.0` marks the ChecklistDek rebrand (no new columns). Hub notes persist via `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::add_step_note()` / `update_step( …, [ 'notes' => … ] )`. `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::completion_rate()` uses a single aggregate on non-archived runs. `CHECKLISTDEK_Run_Repository::all()` excludes archived runs unless `include_archived` is true. Audit log and webhooks accept legacy `workflow_*` action keys and `details.workflow` for pre-migration entries. Client panel audit actions: `client_run_pushed`, `client_step_completed`, `client_step_uncompleted`, `client_step_note_added`, `manual_step_uncompleted`, `run_archived`, `run_deleted`. Integration audit actions: `integration_sync`, `integration_push`, `telemetry_rules_updated`.

